{"language_code":"swe","language_probability":1.0,"text":"Det här är produkten alla i mina kommentarer pratar om. Jag trodde det var för bra för att vara sant. En trärulle som slipar kniven perfekt utan att jag behöver kunna något. Så jag kollade recensionerna om och om igen. Vassaste kniven jag haft. Så enkel. Önskar jag köpt den tidigare. Rullknivslipen i trä har redan blivit favoriten i köksskåp runt om i Sverige. Ingen slipsten, ingen övning. Bara en fast tjugo graders vinkel som gör jobbet åt dig. Se själv varför så många väljer den och varför de aldrig går tillbaka.","words":[{"text":"Det","start":0.12,"end":0.18,"type":"word","logprob":-0.00016318420239258558},{"text":" ","start":0.18,"end":0.22,"type":"spacing","logprob":-0.000013589766240329482},{"text":"här","start":0.22,"end":0.34,"type":"word","logprob":-0.000013589766240329482},{"text":" ","start":0.34,"end":0.36,"type":"spacing","logprob":-1.4305104514278355e-6},{"text":"är","start":0.36,"end":0.46,"type":"word","logprob":-1.4305104514278355e-6},{"text":" ","start":0.46,"end":0.48,"type":"spacing","logprob":-0.00042489083716645837},{"text":"produkten","start":0.5,"end":1.04,"type":"word","logprob":-0.00028334003096119886},{"text":" ","start":1.04,"end":1.3,"type":"spacing","logprob":-0.0000460137271147687},{"text":"alla","start":1.3,"end":1.6,"type":"word","logprob":-0.0000460137271147687},{"text":" ","start":1.6,"end":1.82,"type":"spacing","logprob":-5.960462772236497e-7},{"text":"i","start":1.84,"end":1.88,"type":"word","logprob":-5.960462772236497e-7},{"text":" ","start":1.88,"end":1.92,"type":"spacing","logprob":-6.9141146923357155e-6},{"text":"mina","start":1.92,"end":2.14,"type":"word","logprob":-6.9141146923357155e-6},{"text":" ","start":2.14,"end":2.16,"type":"spacing","logprob":-0.0010714748641476035},{"text":"kommentarer","start":2.16,"end":2.76,"type":"word","logprob":-0.0006388792958205158},{"text":" ","start":2.76,"end":2.92,"type":"spacing","logprob":-2.145764938177308e-6},{"text":"pratar